370 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 292 0 R
/E (Modern wafer inspection requires the same site to be revisited accurately across repeated dies. In Phase 2, the target may appear with unknown translation, rotation and scale, while SEM degradation and highly periodic layouts can create multiple visually similar candidates. The system must also distinguish target-present from target-absent cases.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
